# TEMPLATE ONLY; no installation or sshd reload performed.
# Verify cloud-init/vendor Match blocks with sshd -T / -C before future application.
PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
AllowUsers __DEDICATED_ADMIN_ACCOUNT__
AllowAgentForwarding no
AllowTcpForwarding no
X11Forwarding no
PermitTunnel no
MaxAuthTries 3
# Binding to VPN-only SSH is a LATER gate: preserve verified console recovery
# and an existing working session until second-session key login is confirmed.
# No wildcard sudo/docker-group access for executors or the AI developer.
